            <!-- Title -->
            <h3 class="blog-filter-item__title">
                The Mythos Lesson: Your Cloud Needs to Defend Itself            </h3>

            <!-- Excerpt -->
            <div class="blog-filter-item__excerpt">
                Claude Mythos proved that every organization should assume vulnerabilities will be found and breaches can happen. But the attack chain only starts there. The real cloud security test is how far your environment lets an attacker go. As AI accelerates attack-path discovery, the answer is not faster response alone. It is a hardened, secure-by-design cloud architecture that blocks the attacker’s next move before it succeeds.            </div>

